Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement real-time streaming, timeout handling, and
 fallback error states for AI Mentor chat  #75)

Description
This PR resolves  Issue #75 by introducing robust real-time text streaming and graceful degradation for the AI Mentor chat interface.

Changes Included:
Real-Time Streaming: Refactored the backend /api/chat route to use streamText and return text stream responses, eliminating high TTFB lag.

Frontend Streaming Integration: Updated ChatInterface.tsx to utilize @ai-sdk/react (useChat), rendering incoming markdown chunks dynamically with a typewriter effect.

Auto-Scrolling: Implemented dynamic bottom-anchored scrolling that follows live streaming text without locking user scroll freedom.

Timeout & Error Handling: Added robust timeout protection and an isolated error card with a Retry button, ensuring the rest of the dashboard remains fully operational if external AI APIs experience latency or downtime.
